        "original_id": "57c65a32-f39c-52b7-834e-57c5dba7ffda",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Ontario Mills, Great Mall of the Bay Area, Milpitas, California\n- Companies: Simon Property Group, Ford Motor Land Development, Petrie Dierman Kughn\n- Topics: Mills landmarks, outlet shopping malls\n\nFacts:\n- The Great Mall of the Bay Area is a large indoor outlet shopping mall in Milpitas, California.\n- Ford Motor Land Development and Petrie Dierman Kughn built the Great Mall of the Bay Area in 1994.\n- Since April 2007, Simon Property Group has owned Ontario Mills as one of three Mills landmarks in California.",
